<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-March state budget deficit SKK 3.45 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-March state budget deficit SKK 3.45 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak state budget posted a deficit of 3.45 billion crowns for the first three months of 1997, compared with a deficit of 361.3 million crowns at the end of February, the Finance Ministry said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>				 JAN-MARCH 1997	JAN-FEB 1997</p>
<p> Expenditures (SKK BLN)    43.374		  26.135</p>
<p> Revenues			39.923		  25.774</p>
<p> Balance			  3.450		   0.361</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
